{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**The problem.** Given a string `s` of lowercase letters, return `true` if it can become a palindrome after deleting **at most one** character."
    },
    {
      "type": "drawing",
      "src": "/drawings/60bfe9ee-a919-40d9-b423-9a71ba04c300.svg",
      "alt": "The string a, b, c, a. The outer a's match, but the inner pair b and c don't. Delete b and the rest, a c a, is a palindrome. Delete c instead and a b a is a palindrome too. Either way the answer is true.",
      "width": 567,
      "height": 354,
